s/inline-drawer#aria","content":"For the sidebar rail, the toggle is your own control (e.g. a `ToggleButton`) — give icon-only buttons an `aria-label`, and the content stays in the DOM and accessible since nothing is hidden."},"571":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-30","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"Accordion → `Button slot=\"trigger\"` + `InlineDrawerPanel`. Sidebar rail → controlled state + always-visible children."},"572":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-31","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"For the rail, use numeric (px) `minSize`/`maxSize` so the width animates; `min-content`/`max-content` fit the content exactly but won't animate."},"573":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-32","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"`placement` does not flip in RTL; the side is decided by document/flex order."},"574":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-33","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"Don't nest InlineDrawers."},"575":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-34","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#props","content":"The `InlineDrawerPanel` component accepts the following props:"},"576":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"page","content":"ListBox","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox"},"577":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-0","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox","content":"ListBox is a selectable collection of items rendered inline. Use it for non-popover pickers, inline lists, or as a building block for higher-level components like Select."},"578":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-1","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#features","content":"Features"},"579":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-2","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#installation","content":"Installation"},"580":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-3","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#examples","content":"Examples"},"581":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-4","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#default","content":"Default"},"582":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-5","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#list-box-controlled","content":"List Box Controlled"},"583":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-6","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#list-box-multiple","content":"List Box Multiple"},"584":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-7","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#props","content":"Props"},"585":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-8","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#features","content":"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."},"586":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-9","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."},"587":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-10","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#features","content":"**Layout primi